    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Chinese-style monster hell rescue roguelike dungeon game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingenious level design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 5 chapters and over 100 random levels. Meanwhile, we innovatively incorporate more random generation algorithms within each level to create a more interesting level experience, allowing you to enjoy unique fun in every cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Schools of thought with diverse styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a plethora of divine blessings such as archer, summoning, lightning, Bloodthirsty, and more, as well as a unique and powerful awakening skill. Understand these complex mechanisms and build your own Rampage genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.poster.avif?t=1754875407\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.webm?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.mp4?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich props and relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 50 rare relics. They only function for a few rounds, but don't be small. Maybe one of their effects can save you from danger. At the same time, be careful of those enemies who have turned into evil spirits. Once you are injured, you will be cursed. They will limit your abilities and even pull you directly into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching out an interesting plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a meticulously designed storyline, and we have also incorporated some random plot elements: encounter characters with diverse personalities in scenes such as the secret realm created by the backlight, the eerie and terrifying hell palace, and the village and mountain forests of past lives, communicate with them, give gifts, and engage in mutual slaughter. Embark on a series of interesting love and hate, reconcile with past lives, and ultimately repent and be reborn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bloodthirsty gun fired firmly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying any creature or entity will send particles flying. Survive in the perilous situation of bullets and shells, enhance your abilities and pour out those merciless magic balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.poster.avif?t=1754875407\" width=556 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.webm?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.mp4?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A destructible and highly free open experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks all have the potential to destroy walls or plots, demonstrate superb body skills on changing terrains, or dig for mysterious hidden rewards (including traps).</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Chinese-style monster hell rescue roguelike dungeon game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingenious level design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 5 chapters and over 100 random levels. Meanwhile, we innovatively incorporate more random generation algorithms within each level to create a more interesting level experience, allowing you to enjoy unique fun in every cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Schools of thought with diverse styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a plethora of divine blessings such as archer, summoning, lightning, Bloodthirsty, and more, as well as a unique and powerful awakening skill. Understand these complex mechanisms and build your own Rampage genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.poster.avif?t=1754875407\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.webm?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/fba2ae60aee7440ab31fddc4f2474857.mp4?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich props and relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 50 rare relics. They only function for a few rounds, but don't be small. Maybe one of their effects can save you from danger. At the same time, be careful of those enemies who have turned into evil spirits. Once you are injured, you will be cursed. They will limit your abilities and even pull you directly into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching out an interesting plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a meticulously designed storyline, and we have also incorporated some random plot elements: encounter characters with diverse personalities in scenes such as the secret realm created by the backlight, the eerie and terrifying hell palace, and the village and mountain forests of past lives, communicate with them, give gifts, and engage in mutual slaughter. Embark on a series of interesting love and hate, reconcile with past lives, and ultimately repent and be reborn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bloodthirsty gun fired firmly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying any creature or entity will send particles flying. Survive in the perilous situation of bullets and shells, enhance your abilities and pour out those merciless magic balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.poster.avif?t=1754875407\" width=556 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.webm?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584140/extras/7a1204bc9e01076d35667d3a40d8d403.mp4?t=1754875407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A destructible and highly free open experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks all have the potential to destroy walls or plots, demonstrate superb body skills on changing terrains, or dig for mysterious hidden rewards (including traps).</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A rogue-like dungeon crawler with Chinese mythic horror. Play as an ancient butcher, trapped in the cycles of the underworld. Seek redemption, gain the aid of heavenly gods, and fight for freedom\u2014and for the wife you still love.",
